<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 12.08 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 12.08 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 12.08 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements at a steady and fixed rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 10 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 7.22 billion schillings in two-week repos at three percent, filling six percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 256</p>
